          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "A domain-specific business analyst combines requirement-gathering skills with knowledge of an industry such as banking, insurance, healthcare or retail, and the careers that grow fastest are those where the analyst understands the rules, processes and data of that domain well enough to question them."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Pick one domain, learn its core processes and regulations, and build a sample requirements pack for a realistic process."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Check current official guidance and the employer's compliance policy."
          }
        ]
      },
